  "description": "T1 1 x Platanus x hispanica: Crown lift by 2m,  pruning low hanging branches secondary branches only, leaving a well-balanced crown. Reduce back off adjacent wall/building to give 2m clearance. Reduce Previously reduced, overextended, low lateral branches, growing over the paved area to the East by approximately 1.5-2m shaping into upper crown.  Remove Massaria infected branches with a diameter of up to 100mm and remove deadwood.\rT2 1 x Platanus x hispanica: Crown lift by 2m,  pruning low hanging branches secondary branches only, leaving a well-balanced crown. Reduce Previously reduced, overextended, low lateral branches, growing over the paved area to the East by approximately 1.5-2m shaping into upper crown. Remove Massaria infected branches with a diameter of up to 100mm and remove deadwood.\rT3 1 x Platanus x hispanica: Crown lift by 2m,  pruning low hanging branches secondary branches only, leaving a well-balanced crown.  Reduce back off adjacent wall/building to give 2m clearance. Reduce Over-extended branch adjacent to the National Insitute for Health Building by 1.5m to balance crown. Remove Massaria infected branches with a diameter of up to 100mm and remove deadwood.\r"
